/Title (The exact-record deduplication process reduced the dataset from 1,025 observations to 302 unique observations. The deduplicated cohort comprised 165 positive cases \(54.6%\) and 137 negative cases \(45.4%\), maintaining a reasonably balanced class distribution.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 811 0 R
/Prev 963 0 R
>>
