/Title (Random Forest, XGBoost, and the Stacking Ensemble all achieved 100.00% accuracy and an AUC of 1.0000 on the held-out test partition. The Decision Tree achieved 98.54% accuracy. Logistic Regression and Gaussian Naive Bayes performed at more moderate levels \(80.98% and 82.93% respectively\), consistent with simpler linear or probabilistic decision boundaries.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 970 0 R
